 "name": "Bruce Banner // Hulk: Gamma Smash",
 "notes": [
  "Nov 24, 2026: collapsed to two versions. Main list is now the Ideal: the primer Caltrops combo list with She-Hulk, Attorney-at-Law (illegal, white identity) replaced by Natural Order. 3 Game Changers (Gifts Ungiven, Gamble, Natural Order); plays Bracket 3/4. \"Sleeve Tonight\" swaps the 6 cards not owned for owned stand-ins. The old main list and the Bracket 3 (Caltrops), Best of Both and Original versions are still in the mtg-data decks/ mirror (bruce-banner-hulk.json) until the next vault export; the GitHub backup push failed Nov 24.",
  "Combo: Caltrops + attacking Incredible Hulk — Caltrops damages Hulk on every attack → counter, untap, extra combat, repeat. Tutors: Gifts Ungiven, Gamble, Whir of Invention.",
  "MOONMIST RULE: it prevents combat damage from every non-Werewolf/Wolf that turn, Hulk included. Cast it at the end of an opponent's turn to flip Bruce cheaply, never on your attack turn. Caltrops and Pyrohemia damage is not combat damage.",
  "Primer Gifts piles: (1) Caltrops + Eternal Witness + Bala Ged Recovery + Noxious Revival; (2) with Caltrops in hand: Heroic Intervention + Moonmist + Arcane Denial + Noxious Revival. Whir of Invention for X=3 at end of turn puts Caltrops onto the battlefield.",
  "Mulligan (primer): keep 2–3 lands, a 1–2 mana ramp piece, and draw or a tutor/combo piece; ship slow hands of 5+ mana Hulks.",
  "Backup if the combo is answered: Natural Order into a fatty, The Thing, Rhino, Hulk Strongest There Is, World War Hulk, Unnatural Growth, Last March of the Ents, Pyrohemia and Iron Fist extra combats."
 ],
