   "name": "Bruce Banner // Hulk: Caltrops Combo (Sleeve Tonight)",
   "notes": [
    "Nov 24, 2026: buildable tonight. Stand-ins: Savage Land Dinosaur for Natural Order; Call Damage Control for Whir of Invention; Regrowth for Noxious Revival; Negate for Bala Ged Recovery (combo protection); Ancestral Communion for Eternal Witness; Swiftfoot Boots for Moonmist (haste + hexproof so a recast Hulk swings right away); Sol Ring for Pyrohemia (placeholder — swap to Savage Beating if one turns up). Swiftfoot Boots and Sol Ring pulled from the Doom precon.",
    "Gifts pile tonight: Caltrops + Regrowth + Call Damage Control + Ancestral Communion — whichever two they bin, you get Caltrops back.",
    "Upgrade path: swap each stand-in back for its Ideal card as you get them. When Bala Ged Recovery comes in, it takes Negate's slot and the deck returns to 35 lands."
